WEBVTT

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:12.950
<i>Demon Masato, in an effort to get revenge 
on Rinne, has taken Reiji's soul to Hell.</i>

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:23.210
It's...

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:29.840
Hell?

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:34.010
Rinne-kun, do you have 
an admission pass to Hell?

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:34.970
No.

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:37.980
<i>Jigoca, the admission pass to Hell.</i>

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:43.980
<i>Just a tap on the ticket gate, and you 
can get in without waiting in line.</i>

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:47.940
<i>Welcome to Hell.</i>

00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:49.270
Tch.

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:52.440
<i>Please tap your pass.</i>

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:57.900
<i>If you do not have a pass, please 
pay the admission fee of 1,800 yen.</i>

00:00:57.900 --> 00:00:59.580
I don't have that money!

00:01:02.650 --> 00:01:05.700
Illegal entry!

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:09.000
Stop!

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:19.930
Pay the admission fee!

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:23.810
Free

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:23.160
Look!

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:25.460
Perfect!

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:28.250
It's an emergency, 
I don't have time to deal with you.

00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:41.190
<i>You used them, huh?</i>

00:01:41.190 --> 00:01:44.580
<i>I casually left those bananas there.</i>

00:01:45.670 --> 00:01:49.910
Rinne-kun, how much will you sacrifice

00:01:49.910 --> 00:01:53.090
to save Reiji's soul that's been bottled up?

00:01:54.350 --> 00:01:57.050
Welcome to Hell.

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:32.540
Welcome to Hell!

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:34.490
This telephone pole is where Reiji-san's 
living spirit was deep in thought.

00:03:34.490 --> 00:03:35.560
Ah.

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:40.530
It's the site of the accident. 
I think he lost something here.

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:44.490
I don't see anything that might be it.

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:47.450
It's been days since the accident.

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:50.960
Then maybe we should talk to witnesses.

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:52.790
What's that?

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:54.710
A Tsukumogami Sticker.

00:03:55.120 --> 00:04:00.540
<i>A Tsukumogami is a tool who has, 
over a long period of time, gained a soul.</i>

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:06.360
<i>A Tsukumogami Sticker is a handy tool 
that immediately gives any tool a soul.</i>

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:08.430
<i>Tag price, 99 yen.</i>

00:04:08.740 --> 00:04:10.020
I see.

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:11.180
This telephone pole would...

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:13.520
Yes, it would have seen everything.

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:19.870
Those damn dogs!

00:04:19.870 --> 00:04:22.860
Pissing all over me day after day!

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:25.770
Um, I'd like to talk to you.

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:26.350
Especially Lucifer!

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:27.070
I won't forgive him!

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:29.080
Lucifer?

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:30.730
That damn dog!

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:35.710
Day after day after day after day!

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:39.400
We got no leads, huh?

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:41.210
I'm kind of fed up.

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:44.090
He just complained about dogs non-stop.

00:04:44.660 --> 00:04:48.230
Especially about a dog named Lucifer.

00:04:48.230 --> 00:04:50.190
Not again, Lucifer!

00:04:51.360 --> 00:04:53.630
Bringing home weird junk again!

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:01.200
That box...

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:04.190
Moyori General Hospital

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:09.540
Is this Reiji's?

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:10.330
Yes.

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:11.240
Probably.

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:14.200
I think he dropped it when 
he got in the accident.

00:05:14.770 --> 00:05:19.210
Reiji-san must have become a living 
spirit and left in order to find that.

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:24.950
It's the pair rings I wanted.

00:05:26.920 --> 00:05:29.390
I see... if only he hadn't 
gotten in the accident...

00:05:30.450 --> 00:05:31.880
We're matching!

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:34.390
You would have worn that ring together.

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:41.220
Reiji!

00:05:41.220 --> 00:05:43.260
Why did you die?

00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:45.650
Um, he's not dead yet.

00:05:46.510 --> 00:05:51.340
Tell Suzu, if she ever finds 
the thing, to throw it out.

00:05:52.020 --> 00:05:56.450
<i>Reiji-san's living spirit 
sounded like he'd given up,</i>

00:05:57.550 --> 00:05:59.050
<i>but we can't allow that.</i>

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:06.090
Stop, Masato!

00:06:07.870 --> 00:06:10.530
<i>Where's he going?</i>

00:06:10.530 --> 00:06:13.300
<i>Normally, a spirit taken to Hell</i>

00:06:13.300 --> 00:06:16.770
<i>is handed over to the right staff 
according to their evil deeds.</i>

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:19.890
Scammers, gather here.

00:06:19.890 --> 00:06:22.240
Thieves over here.

00:06:22.240 --> 00:06:25.320
Blackmail? Go to the reception 
desk on the second floor.

00:06:25.770 --> 00:06:29.450
<i>Reiji isn't a sinner. He's not even dead.</i>

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:31.140
<i>Where is he going?</i>

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:35.780
Hey!

00:06:35.780 --> 00:06:37.230
Help me!

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:38.330
Hey!

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:39.220
Let me out!

00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:40.670
I'm over here!

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:42.050
I'm over here!

00:06:42.050 --> 00:06:43.460
No, I'm here!

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:45.500
Living Spirit Reiji.

00:06:45.730 --> 00:06:47.590
Let me out, break the bottle.

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:48.510
Hurry.

00:06:51.530 --> 00:06:54.520
There just happen to be bats and balls here.

00:06:51.950 --> 00:06:54.930
Free to use

00:06:55.300 --> 00:06:57.340
Just what I need.

00:06:57.340 --> 00:07:01.440
I just need to break each of these bottles, 
and one of them will be the real thing.

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:04.610
<i>But it reeks of a trap.</i>

00:07:05.140 --> 00:07:07.620
<i>Reiji thinks his girlfriend Suzu hates him.</i>

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:09.990
<i>He's unwilling to go on living.</i>

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:13.320
<i>Would he really ask for help so easily?</i>

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:17.120
What's wrong, Rinne-kun? 
Hurry up and hit the balls.

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:22.140
The real one's over there!

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:28.200
Who was that?!

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:30.300
Who broke my window?!

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:31.650
Him.

00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:36.180
You tricky little brat!

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:40.390
Old Mister Lightning is angry again.

00:07:40.630 --> 00:07:43.100
Why you!

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:49.400
Damn, so it was a clever trap after all.

00:07:50.810 --> 00:07:54.320
I didn't expect Mister 
Lightning, but it worked out.

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:58.420
Rinne-kun, you've really made a mess.

00:07:58.420 --> 00:07:59.330
Masato.

00:07:59.710 --> 00:08:04.100
Naturally, since you came in illegally, 
you'll be the one with the repair bills.

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:06.880
Including what the oni destroyed, of course.

00:08:07.180 --> 00:08:11.460
I never did care about Reiji's living spirit.

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:18.640
What I really wanted was 
to put you into Debt Hell.

00:08:18.920 --> 00:08:22.420
You aren't getting out of jail 
until you pay for the damages.

00:08:22.420 --> 00:08:24.560
Not even if you're a shinigami.

00:08:26.710 --> 00:08:32.810
<i>Debt Hell: a hell of hells, 
located at the bottom level of Hell.</i>

00:08:32.810 --> 00:08:45.080
Artist's Rendering

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:36.820
<i>Those who amass debt in 
Hell are brought here,</i>

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:39.030
<i>where they are forced
 to labor for eternity.</i>

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:45.080
<i>They are never paid for their labor, 
so they can never repay their debts.</i>

00:08:45.350 --> 00:08:49.490
You can never escape Debt Hell.

00:08:49.490 --> 00:08:52.550
That's the revenge I've prepared for you.

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:57.300
That aside, you better return Reiji's 
living spirit to the living world.

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:59.690
Oh, this?

00:08:59.690 --> 00:09:02.980
I was only using him as a 
hostage to lure you here.

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:06.020
I don't need him anymore. It's garbage.

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:11.760
Go ahead, chase it.

00:09:11.760 --> 00:09:15.450
It'll only take you to Debt Hell.

00:09:20.470 --> 00:09:22.620
Mrowrrr

00:09:22.890 --> 00:09:26.870
Hell isn't at the same 
place as the Rinne no Wa?

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:28.550
Of course.

00:09:28.550 --> 00:09:33.610
People who are taken to Hell aren't allowed 
to board the Rinne no Wa to be reborn.

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:36.170
It's a completely different afterlife.

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:38.390
There.

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:41.050
Sakura-sama, that's Hell.

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:43.930
Hell's a building?

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:44.720
Yes.

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:48.060
It's a brand-new government building.

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:52.840
<i>With the growing population, 
the number of sinners also grows.</i>

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:55.640
<i>This cutting edge, 
high-tech general facility of Hell</i>

00:09:55.640 --> 00:10:01.420
<i>was built in order to process the increasing 
demand for afterlife procedures.</i>

00:10:01.420 --> 00:10:05.330
Commuters' Hell; Exam Hell; Deadline Hell;

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:07.570
Ant Lion Hell, where people 
are stuck in bad situations...

00:10:07.570 --> 00:10:10.170
there are all kinds of Hell here.

00:10:10.520 --> 00:10:14.840
They also have living facilities here 
for the busy oni working in Hell:

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:19.970
a Hell Supermarket, a Hell Dentist, 
and a Hell Fire Department.

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:22.470
That sounds really livable.

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:26.730
The Hell Ministry of Health, Labor and 
Welfare is getting really naggy lately.

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:27.640
Hm?

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:30.040
We have an illegal entry!

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:31.990
He didn't pay for his admission.

00:10:31.990 --> 00:10:32.980
Hurry!

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:36.280
I bet they're talking about Rokudou-kun.

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:38.900
Oh, no!

00:10:40.050 --> 00:10:42.110
This place is kind of broken down.

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:47.910
If Rinne-sama was involved, 
they're going to charge him for repairs.

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:53.230
He might need a lot of money for this.

00:10:54.230 --> 00:10:57.410
Huh? I don't have that much.

00:10:57.410 --> 00:11:00.050
Not to worry.

00:11:01.060 --> 00:11:02.730
Cash cards?

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:07.230
I kept the cards Masato threw in his attack.

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:09.360
They're probably fakes again.

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:13.060
You'd think so, but he actually 
threw a real one, too.

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:15.520
Is he stupid? Is it a trap?

00:11:15.830 --> 00:11:18.530
See, it says "real" here.

00:11:15.830 --> 00:11:18.530
Real

00:11:19.090 --> 00:11:21.360
I'm pretty sure that's a trap.

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:27.620
Withdraw all!

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:48.390
What the?!

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:53.460
Nice try, the real one is over here.

00:11:54.010 --> 00:11:56.210
Rinne-kun, look down.

00:11:57.020 --> 00:11:59.400
You're almost at Debt Hell.

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:01.680
Wash them faster!

00:12:01.680 --> 00:12:04.030
We have plenty of dishes!

00:12:04.430 --> 00:12:14.540
Wash a plate for Pops, wash a second for Mom.

00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:16.370
One more!

00:12:15.550 --> 00:12:26.620
Wash a plate for Pops, 
wash a second for Mom...

00:12:16.370 --> 00:12:20.440
Stack one more, and I'll get paid.

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:21.840
I'm taking these.

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:23.050
That's just wrong!

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:25.110
Wash them!

00:12:27.560 --> 00:12:38.320
Wash a plate for Pops, 
wash a second for Mom...

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:42.260
All right, we're done 
repairing the water pipe.

00:12:43.220 --> 00:12:45.850
All right, we're digging here again.

00:12:45.850 --> 00:12:48.330
This time for a gas pipe.

00:12:50.510 --> 00:12:54.250
Work as they may, they'll never be paid.

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:56.960
You'll be working there for free forever.

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:03.970
We're at the Hell Shopping Floor.

00:13:04.180 --> 00:13:05.250
What?!

00:13:05.670 --> 00:13:09.100
That's the repair shop that I had 
my Shinigami Scythe repaired at!

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:20.420
Blacksmith Repairs

00:13:09.420 --> 00:13:12.420
<i>The repair shop has a branch in Hell, too.</i>

00:13:12.420 --> 00:13:14.620
<i>Anyone can now ask for repairs at one branch,</i>

00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:16.670
<i>and have the item sent to 
another through the Reidou.</i>

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:21.960
<i>Be sure to try their Peace 
of Mind Anywhere service.</i>

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:23.440
My Shinigami scythe!

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:29.570
I can't allow you to have it until 
you pay off the repair fees.

00:13:31.140 --> 00:13:33.830
You won't find any weapons for free here.

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:38.560
The oni guards won't let you shoplift.

00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:40.390
They won't let you pay later.

00:13:40.390 --> 00:13:45.160
You were set to lose the moment you 
stepped into Hell without a single penny.

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:47.800
I'll pay for the repairs.

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:51.220
Thank you, come again.

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:55.350
A Shinigami scythe:

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:58.550
a fitting end to a shinigami like you.

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:04.230
I'll shred you up before you go to Debt Hell.

00:14:07.720 --> 00:14:08.860
Nice dodge.

00:14:09.350 --> 00:14:10.990
I didn't do anything.

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:12.970
The snakes did.

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:17.470
You guys are going to get 
hurt if you stay around me.

00:14:19.850 --> 00:14:21.310
Pointless resistance!

00:14:21.310 --> 00:14:23.500
You're not going to defeat me unarmed!

00:14:26.140 --> 00:14:28.260
If only I had the money 
to buy shinigami tools...

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:34.220
He gave up and submitted 
himself to Debt Hell.

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:35.770
Hand over the sponge!

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:40.290
I haven't been living on 
part-time jobs for nothing!

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:42.110
Don't mess with me!

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:44.330
I'm done washing.

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:45.820
Now pay me.

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:46.780
Very well.

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:49.280
Yes! Now I can buy a weapon.

00:14:49.670 --> 00:14:52.200
Give me the bill at the end of the month,

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:56.330
and I'll deposit that amount 
minus taxes two months later.

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:57.980
That's not soon enough.

00:14:57.980 --> 00:14:59.590
Pay me in advance.

00:14:59.590 --> 00:15:02.430
I can't pay you in advance unless 
you're a full-time employee.

00:15:02.430 --> 00:15:03.500
What do I do?

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:06.340
You'll need a three month trial period.

00:15:06.690 --> 00:15:07.710
That's too late!

00:15:08.090 --> 00:15:10.190
Nice try, Rinne-kun.

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:12.450
This may be Hell, but it's 
still a government building.

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:14.680
They can't bend the rules for you!

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:22.970
Good!

00:15:22.970 --> 00:15:25.070
You're going to be defeated by poverty!

00:15:28.640 --> 00:15:30.710
So much money!

00:15:30.710 --> 00:15:33.320
What do we do, Sakura-sama?

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:35.530
Should we buy some land?

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:40.470
No, we should invest in Hell Dollars 
while the Hell Yen's still strong.

00:15:40.470 --> 00:15:41.700
What are you talking about?

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:43.960
We're bringing it to Rokudou-kun.

00:15:44.350 --> 00:15:46.340
The illegal entrant is 
apparently a shinigami!

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:48.420
He escaped towards Debt Hell!

00:15:48.810 --> 00:15:50.790
They're talking about Rokudou-kun.

00:15:50.790 --> 00:15:52.360
Let's go, Rokumon-chan.

00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:53.180
Okay.

00:15:59.180 --> 00:16:01.000
To think you'd cause even more damage.

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:03.020
You're even deeper in debt!

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:06.440
Give up, Rinne-kun.

00:16:10.350 --> 00:16:13.950
Surrender, unless you want to pay for more.

00:16:16.010 --> 00:16:17.650
Rokudou-kun!

00:16:19.060 --> 00:16:20.870
Rinne-sama!

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:23.000
Rokumon! Mamiya Sakura!

00:16:25.770 --> 00:16:26.840
That money...

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:31.210
Masato-kun, sorry, but we 
withdrew all your savings.

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:33.360
Oh?

00:16:33.360 --> 00:16:36.090
<i>You fool, you used the card!</i>

00:16:36.420 --> 00:16:39.220
Mamiya Sakura, hand over those bills!

00:16:42.620 --> 00:16:44.370
<i>You fell for it.</i>

00:16:44.370 --> 00:16:48.490
<i>That cash card you used was a complete fake.</i>

00:16:48.950 --> 00:16:51.230
<i>Those bills you withdrew are all fake.</i>

00:16:51.930 --> 00:16:55.610
<i>The moment you use a fake bill 
on the Hell Shopping Floor,</i>

00:16:55.610 --> 00:17:03.120
<i>Rinne-kun, you and your friends are 
going to Hell Jail, never to escape.</i>

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:07.130
<i>Now, Rinne-kun, 
buy a weapon with that money!</i>

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:14.070
What's wrong?

00:17:14.070 --> 00:17:15.220
Why aren't you buying a weapon?

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:17.680
This is my weapon.

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:20.720
Thousand Winds Stream!

00:17:21.090 --> 00:17:24.600
<i>The Thousand Winds Stream is a 
shinigami special attack in which</i>

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:27.340
<i>one blasts 1,000 yen bills on a gust of wind.</i>

00:17:27.340 --> 00:17:32.230
<i>It's even more powerful using 
5,000 yen and 10,000 yen bills.</i>

00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:34.330
Oh, wow.

00:17:34.330 --> 00:17:35.950
What a waste.

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:46.290
You bastard!

00:17:51.770 --> 00:17:55.380
Masato, you better stop 
now, or you'll get hurt.

00:17:56.610 --> 00:17:58.440
I'm not surrendering to you.

00:17:58.440 --> 00:18:01.260
I'd rather be diced by that scythe!

00:18:04.780 --> 00:18:08.270
Ow! Ow!

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:11.900
Relax, I just hit you with the back.

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:15.190
I said I'd rather be diced!

00:18:15.770 --> 00:18:17.230
Money!

00:18:17.230 --> 00:18:19.970
I can finally get out of Debt Hell!

00:18:20.560 --> 00:18:22.330
This is a fake bill!

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:25.200
You! Use this money and you'll go to jail!

00:18:27.910 --> 00:18:29.310
Fake bills?

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:32.440
You must have realized, Rinne-kun.

00:18:32.900 --> 00:18:34.800
That's why you didn't buy a weapon.

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:40.740
No, the Thousand Winds Stream doesn't 
work without a lot of money.

00:18:40.740 --> 00:18:42.450
It's an extravagant attack.

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:44.510
I couldn't help it.

00:18:45.650 --> 00:18:47.640
So you got excited.

00:18:47.990 --> 00:18:49.540
There you are!

00:18:49.960 --> 00:18:51.150
Hey, you!

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:54.180
<i>It's over, Rinne-kun.</i>

00:18:54.180 --> 00:18:57.900
<i>You're still going to be charged with 
illegal entry and property damage.</i>

00:18:57.900 --> 00:19:00.450
<i>You'll be worked to the bone in Debt Hell.</i>

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:03.670
Who forged these bills?!

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:08.750
Forgery is severely punished, 
whether you're a shinigami or a demon.

00:19:10.600 --> 00:19:12.700
Me! Pick me!

00:19:12.700 --> 00:19:14.760
You know who did it?

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:16.550
You see...

00:19:16.550 --> 00:19:17.550
Shoot.

00:19:17.900 --> 00:19:19.880
Cash Card Cut!

00:19:24.450 --> 00:19:26.760
I don't know who did it.

00:19:28.340 --> 00:19:29.390
<i>Rinne-kun.</i>

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:32.520
<i>Rokudou-kun. Why are you defending him?</i>

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:35.250
You're the illegal entrant, aren't you?

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:36.260
Yeah.

00:19:36.260 --> 00:19:39.150
But about the admission 
fee and the repair fees,

00:19:40.520 --> 00:19:41.830
my friend here will pay for it.

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:43.450
Friend?!

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:46.240
Do you really not know who did it?

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:49.490
I could have you exempt 
from the admission fee

00:19:49.490 --> 00:19:52.580
and repair fees if you tell 
us who forged the bills.

00:19:52.940 --> 00:19:55.140
Oh, really? In that case...

00:19:55.890 --> 00:19:57.160
I'll pay for it.

00:19:57.160 --> 00:19:58.310
He's my friend, after all.

00:20:00.610 --> 00:20:03.930
I'm glad you got out of Hell, Rinne-sama.

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:07.880
Now all we have to do is bring Reiji's 
living spirit back to his body.

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:10.600
Reiji-san, can you hear me?

00:20:11.430 --> 00:20:12.740
Leave me alone.

00:20:13.170 --> 00:20:15.770
Suzu hates me now.

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:19.030
There's no point going back to my body.

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:22.280
Reiji-san, look at your left hand.

00:20:22.810 --> 00:20:24.010
My left hand?

00:20:28.440 --> 00:20:33.710
<i>It's the pair ring that I tried 
to give Suzu on her birthday.</i>

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:37.840
Suzu-senpai's waiting with the other ring.

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:41.620
Your friend Tomoya-senpai 
says he wants you to come back, too.

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:43.800
Moyori General Hospital

00:20:45.490 --> 00:20:46.800
Reiji.

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:54.190
Reiji!

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:55.570
Reiji.

00:20:55.570 --> 00:20:56.670
I'm so relieved!

00:20:57.290 --> 00:20:58.360
Suzu.

00:21:00.140 --> 00:21:02.520
Thanks for the pair ring.

00:21:04.790 --> 00:21:06.780
I'm so relieved, Reiji.

00:21:07.560 --> 00:21:08.690
Tomoya.

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:11.030
You're a good guy.

00:21:12.440 --> 00:21:13.960
I'm seriously relieved.

00:21:14.570 --> 00:21:19.320
<i>Hurry up and pay me back for the 
money you used to buy those rings.</i>

00:21:20.420 --> 00:21:22.010
He's back to normal.

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:23.450
Thank goodness.

00:21:23.450 --> 00:21:25.970
Everything's settled now.

00:21:27.650 --> 00:21:30.220
Mamiya Sakura, you're impressive.

00:21:30.560 --> 00:21:31.470
Huh?

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:35.980
It was thanks to you that Reiji's 
living spirit returned to his body.

00:21:36.340 --> 00:21:40.270
You could possibly become a first-rate 
shinigami, if you train for it.

00:21:40.570 --> 00:21:42.740
You can become a shinigami through training?

00:21:43.290 --> 00:21:46.760
Speaking of which, the money 
I've lent you up until now...

00:21:46.760 --> 00:21:51.780
Mamiya Sakura, you could possibly become a 
first-rate shinigami, if you train for it.

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:54.350
I don't really want to.

00:21:54.350 --> 00:21:55.140
That aside—

00:21:55.140 --> 00:21:58.710
You could possibly become 
a first-rate shinigami.

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:00.680
I know, but...

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:04.010
Hell
1st Street

00:22:05.290 --> 00:22:07.510
<i>I lost all my allowance.</i>

00:22:08.400 --> 00:22:11.510
<i>Rinne-kun, I'm not done with you.</i>

00:22:11.960 --> 00:22:13.770
<i>Next time!</i>

00:22:19.490 --> 00:22:23.000
You're the fool that broke 
the window, aren't you?!

00:22:23.000 --> 00:22:25.990
Old Mister Lightning's angry again.

00:22:28.340 --> 00:22:30.590
Rinne-kun!

00:24:01.060 --> 00:24:25.980
Next Episode: 
 The Wig's Disappointment
and the Pumpkin's Temptation

00:24:02.030 --> 00:24:04.420
The school festival's coming up, Mamiya-san!

00:24:04.420 --> 00:24:06.520
My class is running a café.

00:24:06.520 --> 00:24:08.320
The girls are wearing maid uniforms.

00:24:08.320 --> 00:24:10.750
Say what?!

00:24:10.750 --> 00:24:12.320
Is something wrong, Tsubasa-kun?

00:24:12.320 --> 00:24:14.940
I get to see you in maid clothes?!

00:24:14.940 --> 00:24:18.070
I want to see you in cat ears, too!

00:24:18.070 --> 00:24:19.060
I don't have any.

00:24:19.060 --> 00:24:20.120
Sorry.

00:24:20.120 --> 00:24:24.800
Next time on <i>Rin-ne</i>: "The Wig's 
Disappointment and the Pumpkin's Temptation"
